<h2 id="about">Look up scores fast, then compare</h2>
<p>
  Sk8tics lets you type a skater&rsquo;s name and finds their results across Skate Ontario competitions and Skate Canada&rsquo;s national events in seconds rather than an afternoon of opening PDFs. Compare then puts two skates side by side: your last competition against this one to see your own progress, or your skate against another skater&rsquo;s or the winner&rsquo;s from the same segment.
</p>
